<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row justify-content-center">
  <div class="col-md-8 mt-4 mb-4">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <hr>
    <p>Your privacy matters to us. Here's what we collect and why:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Account data:</b> Your name, email and password (stored securely, hashed) are used to identify you on the platform.</li>
      <li><b>Listing and booking data:</b> Used to connect guests with hosts and to keep a history of your bookings.</li>
      <li><b>Notifications:</b> We keep you informed about the status of your bookings and requests.</li>
      <li><b>Cookies &amp; sessions:</b> Used to keep you logged in. Sessions are stored in Redis with a 7-day expiry.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We never sell your personal data. Contact <a href="mailto:support@wanderlust.example">support@wanderlust.example</a> to request deletion of your account data.</p>
  </div>
</div>